<title>FRANCE: EU sells Danish intervention barley, German rye.</title>
<headline>EU sells Danish intervention barley, German rye.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Thursday sold 39,529 tonnes of Danish intervention barley at a minimum price of 97.22 Ecus per tonne for export to countries outside the EU, member country officials said.</p>
<p>The EU also sold 52,842 tonnes of German intervention rye at a minimum price of 96.04 Ecus per tonne, they said.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
